From d4c10582a631600afd32a187806993c6e40d504e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pedro CVLAB <vaz.valois@hotmail.com>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 21:51:03 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Batch 2: give every function one shape a reader can hold

Fixes ALL-FUNC0001, ALL-FUNC0005, ALL-FUNC0007, ALL-FUNC0008, ALL-FUNC0009,
ALL-FUNC0010, ALL-PARA0001, ALL-PARA0003, ALL-PARA0004, ALL-NAMI0001 and
ALL-BRAN0001 on the server. The 60-line serve_forever loop becomes a read loop
over an answer method and one small method per JSON-RPC route, the boolean
flag pairs and the six-parameter metrics renderer go, and the transparent
one-line wrappers are inlined.
---
 mcp_server.py | 251 ++++++++++++++++++++++----------------------------
 mcp_tools.py  | 104 +++++++++------------
 smoke.py      |  17 ++--
 3 files changed, 168 insertions(+), 204 deletions(-)

